WEBVTT

00:16:58.722 --> 00:17:00.599
to combat the climate crisis.

00:17:00.640 --> 00:17:04.186
So how do we, meaning
we at large in a community,

00:17:04.227 --> 00:17:05.979
know and back candidates

00:17:06.021 --> 00:17:08.732
who are going to actually
fight for change?

00:17:08.774 --> 00:17:12.069
Is there certain criteria
that you're using

00:17:12.110 --> 00:17:14.237
and that would stand out for anyone

00:17:14.279 --> 00:17:17.240
who claims to fight
for green legislation?"

00:17:17.824 --> 00:17:18.992
JF: Yeah.

00:17:19.034 --> 00:17:23.038
Number one, do they take money
from the fossil fuel industry?

00:17:23.080 --> 00:17:24.247
That is a no-no,

00:17:24.289 --> 00:17:26.416
because that means that they're not free

00:17:26.458 --> 00:17:29.419
to really stand up
to the fossil fuel industry.

00:17:29.419 --> 00:17:31.838
And here in the United States,
in North America,